---
title: Legacy Society
description: The Rocket Fund Legacy Society lets you endow your giving in perpetuity — a $2,500 minimum, a 4% annual draw, and recognition alongside its current members.
sidearmSlug: legacy-society
cleanUrl: utrockets.com/legacysociety
crumb:
  - label: Ways to Give
    href: /ways-to-give/
---
{% from "components.njk" import hero, sechead, ctaband %}

{% call hero("Rocket Fund Legacy Society", "Give in perpetuity", "Ensure your support for Toledo student-athletes continues forever — an orbit that never decays.", true) %}
<div class="rkt-btnrow">
  <a class="rkt-btn" href="{{ site.legacyFormUrl }}">Request information</a>
</div>
{% endcall %}

<section class="rkt-section">
  <div class="rkt-wrap">
    <div class="rkt-split">
      <div class="rkt-prose rkt-reveal">
        {{ sechead("How it works", "The mechanics of forever") }}
        <p>The Rocket Fund Legacy Society gives every Rocket supporter the opportunity to make their giving permanent through the Rocket Fund endowment.</p>
        <p>Each year, the athletic department may use <strong>{{ legacy.draw }} of the endowment</strong> to address its top priorities. Any investment gains above that are added back to the principal — so the endowment keeps growing, and your support lasts in perpetuity.</p>
        <p>The arithmetic is simple: multiply your annual gift by <strong>{{ legacy.multiplier }}</strong>. If you give $1,000 a year, a $25,000 endowment generates that gift forever. Legacy Society gifts start at <strong>{{ legacy.minimum }}</strong> — the endowment behind a $100 annual gift.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rkt-prose rkt-reveal">
        {{ sechead("Ways to fund it", "Five routes to forever") }}
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Gifts and pledges</strong> — outright, or payable over two to five years</li>
          <li><strong>Bequests</strong> — a provision in your will or trust</li>
          <li><strong>Life insurance</strong> — name the Rocket Fund as beneficiary</li>
          <li><strong>Charitable gift annuities</strong> — income for life, legacy after</li>
          <li><strong>Retirement plan assets</strong> — including IRA charitable rollovers at age 70½+</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Gifts over <strong>{{ legacy.wallRecognition }}</strong> are recognized on the Legacy Society Walls in Savage Arena and the Glass Bowl, and every member is recognized on the video board during games.</p>
        <div class="rkt-btnrow">
          <a class="rkt-btn" href="{{ site.legacyFormUrl }}">Request information</a>
          <a class="rkt-btn rkt-btn--ghost-light" href="/contact/">Talk to our team</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rkt-section rkt-section--navy rkt-section--center">
  <div class="rkt-wrap">
    {{ sechead("The honor roll", "Current members", "The Rockets whose support already lasts forever.", true) }}
    <ul class="rkt-honorroll rkt-reveal">
      {% for m in legacy.members %}
      <li>{{ m }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{{ ctaband("Start a legacy that outlasts every season.", site.legacyFormUrl, "Request information", "/contact/", "Contact us") }}
